Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.19,0:11:03.89,title3,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz270\pos(340,206)}煙火
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.73,0:00:15.74,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}何ページもついやして　綴られた僕らの気分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:22.99,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}どうしてか一行の　空白をうめられない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:31.12,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}押し花の栞はさんで　君と転がす使い捨ての自転車
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:38.71,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}忘れかけの煉瓦を　積み上げた場所にゆこう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.42,0:00:43.95,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}海を見渡す坂をかけのぼって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:48.50,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こわいくらいに青い空と
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.52,0:00:56.25,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}右手にサイダー　左手はずっと君をさがしている
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.95,0:01:04.00,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}そうやって“今”は僕の方へ　問いつめることもなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:10.91,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}まだ二人はすぐそこにいるのに
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.01,0:01:16.88,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}「どうかまた会えますように」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:26.71,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}なんて　どうかしてるみたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.73,0:00:15.74,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}使用好幾頁 填補了我們的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:22.99,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}卻彌補不了那唯一的一行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:31.12,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}夾上乾花書籤 和你乘上騎一次就扔的自行車
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:38.71,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}前往用幾乎遺忘的磚頭堆積起來的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.42,0:00:43.95,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}爬上望得見海的小坡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:48.50,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}頭上是湛藍的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.52,0:00:56.25,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}右手是碳酸飲料 左手一直在尋求著你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.95,0:01:04.00,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}現在呢 你也不會再追問我什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:10.91,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}兩個人明明還在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.01,0:01:16.88,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}「而我卻祈願能再次相遇」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:26.71,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}可能是我的錯覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.09,0:20:25.92,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}君と夏の終わり　将来の夢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.01,0:20:29.02,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}大きな希望　忘れない
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:35.73,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}10年後の8月　また出会えるのを　信じて
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:43.81,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}最高の思い出を…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.24,0:21:03.33,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}出会いは　ふっとした　瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.75,0:21:06.94,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}帰り道の交差点で
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.29,0:21:12.74,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}声をかけてくれたね「一緒に帰ろう」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.59,0:21:17.65,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}僕は　照れくさそうに
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.94,0:21:21.31,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}カバンで顔を隠しながら
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.82,0:21:26.96,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}本当は　とても　とても　嬉しかったよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.97,0:21:33.57,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}あぁ　花火が夜空　きれいに咲いて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.69,0:21:35.72,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}ちょっとセツナク
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.14,0:21:42.23,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}あぁ　風が時間とともに　流れる
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.86,0:21:49.80,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}嬉しくって　楽しくって　冒険も　いろいろしたね
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:56.52,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}二人の　秘密の　基地の中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.02,0:22:00.86,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}君と夏の終わり　将来の夢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:04.06,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}大きな希望を忘れない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.18,0:22:11.16,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}10年後の8月　また出会えるのを　信じて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.35,0:22:13.21,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}君が最後まで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.25,0:22:18.39,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}心から「ありがとう」叫んでたこと　知ってたよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.49,0:22:22.13,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}涙をこらえて　笑顔でさようなら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.14,0:22:25.39,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}せつないよね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.73,0:22:33.21,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\be5}最高の思い出を…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.09,0:20:25.92,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}不會忘記和你度過的夏天 將來的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.01,0:20:29.02,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}和巨大的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:35.73,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}相信著十年後的八月還能與你再會
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:43.81,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}懷著最美好的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.24,0:21:03.33,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}邂逅是瞬間的巧合
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.75,0:21:06.94,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}在回家的路口
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.29,0:21:12.74,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}你對我說「一起回去吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.59,0:21:17.65,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}我還有些害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.94,0:21:21.31,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}用包遮著臉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.82,0:21:26.96,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}其實心裡非常非常高興
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.97,0:21:33.57,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}啊 煙花在夜空裡絢麗地綻放
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.69,0:21:35.72,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}有些傷感
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.14,0:21:42.23,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}啊 風隨著時間一起流動
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.86,0:21:49.80,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}開心的 愉快的冒險也經歷過很多次
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:56.52,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}在兩個人的秘密基地裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.02,0:22:00.86,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}不會忘記和你度過的夏天 將來的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:04.06,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}和巨大的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.18,0:22:11.16,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}相信著十年後的八月還能與你再會
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.35,0:22:13.21,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}我知道你自始至終
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.25,0:22:18.39,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}都在心裡喊「謝謝」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.49,0:22:22.13,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}強忍淚水 笑著說再見
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.14,0:22:25.39,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}有些傷感吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.73,0:22:33.21,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\be5}懷著最美好的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.69,0:01:46.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.27,0:01:54.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是明天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是的好不容易回來也不去學校啥事也不幹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.12,0:02:16.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真囉嗦我會自己整理的出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.22,0:02:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.44,0:02:22.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囉嗦…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.84,0:02:28.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起…對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.68,0:02:33.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  雪集
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.29,0:02:37.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噗噗今晚準備舉行誓師大會  怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.61,0:02:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我想也是  總之在車站前集合
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:49.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如說鶴見同學完全沒有吸取教訓
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:52.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一副只有自己才瞭解雪集的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.96,0:02:58.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身高181CM  體重68KG  喜歡的食物是八橋餅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:02:58.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.41,0:03:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,興趣是女裝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.82,0:03:01.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女裝？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.73,0:03:06.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下鶴見同學話還沒說完  啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:10.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:12.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不帶你這樣亂傳的吧  再怎麼說我…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:16.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好疼…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.63,0:03:26.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鶴見…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來來  動起手來  明天可是芽間將要成佛的大宴會啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.35,0:03:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裝飾也要盛大的做
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間要用紙巾做花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.58,0:03:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  明明你是主角為什麼自己動手來做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:46.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為很有趣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:48.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得很好啊芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.11,0:03:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太別傻愣著用廣告單做垃圾箱去  垃圾箱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:54.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.87,0:03:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垃圾箱？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:04:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前我在班裡不是很不中用嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.83,0:04:03.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了引人注意盡幹蠢事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.46,0:04:06.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過仁太你們把我拉進了圈子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.60,0:04:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我到頭來還是只能看著大家…只能看著
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:19.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噗噗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.87,0:04:26.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…所以說這回全部由我來辦  超豪華的送你走  芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.25,0:04:27.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託您了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.54,0:04:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噗噗真是個好人  嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.68,0:04:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個要怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.41,0:04:42.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能去的吧  要把人耍到什麼地步才行  他們  到底…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.48,0:04:43.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.27,0:04:47.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼！  為什麼小聰！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.73,0:04:48.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  冷靜點
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽啊  我的身高知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.43,0:04:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這一年間長高很多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.95,0:05:17.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真寂寞啊聰志他  還有你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.71,0:05:22.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能忘記芽衣子  這樣就好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.79,0:05:25.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是要寂寞大家一起寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.42,0:05:31.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和聰志還有我  三人一起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.35,0:05:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:47.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煙火飛上天後
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:52.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果芽間消失不見  我以前不知這麼想過多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間消失後  我就可以成為和仁太最好的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我錯了  芽間真的不見了以後
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.76,0:06:10.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和仁太的距離一直在拉大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:17.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在雖然距離又縮短了  但那是因為芽間回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.16,0:06:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難能可貴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:21.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.57,0:06:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.43,0:06:26.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鶴見啊  你好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.91,0:06:28.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天去秘密基地？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.57,0:06:29.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.60,0:06:30.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安城和你一起？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？  啊  是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懦夫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:40.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鶴子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:45.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明那麼勁頭十足的要讓她成佛  一到關鍵時刻就害怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.45,0:06:52.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真丟臉啊  因為害怕  從芽間處逃開了  和安城在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.09,0:06:56.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悲慘的不只是自己  你是要這麼想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.08,0:06:59.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也回想起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.90,0:07:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被芽間的電話叫出來的時候  她所說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.15,0:07:07.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了仁太有事要拜託你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.26,0:07:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.02,0:07:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？  雪集  鶴子她說什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.44,0:07:20.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有事要拜託你  只有你才能辦到的事  安鳴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:31.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼不來啊  他們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.07,0:07:33.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係啦  明天還能見到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.63,0:07:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.59,0:07:36.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去叫他們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  噗噗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.24,0:07:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鶴子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.61,0:07:44.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我買零食來了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.18,0:07:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是鶴子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.65,0:07:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有果汁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.99,0:07:51.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  我愛死你了雪集
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.71,0:07:52.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開Party了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.00,0:07:59.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信著  我相信著的  真高興死了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.58,0:08:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  我好喜歡這個呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.10,0:08:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}聚集起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.70,0:08:04.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊不
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.98,0:08:09.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總感覺離別將至了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.98,0:08:16.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間和我們組成超和平Busters…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:17.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開場白就不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.06,0:08:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.99,0:08:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就有請主角芽間上前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:25.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:28.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}（今天對於為了我所做的事感謝了）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}（芽間明天要成佛了）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}（想和大家要好相處到最後拜託了）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.36,0:08:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間的致辭結束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.48,0:08:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  芽間吃這個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.08,0:08:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼紅吃辣的會痛的不要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辣的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係的  吃一口看看嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.41,0:09:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不…嘴不在這…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.99,0:09:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}沒有餘興節目嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.73,0:09:08.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:12.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這只是單純的吃喝會而已  不是誓師大會嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.99,0:09:14.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,機會難得做點什麼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.03,0:09:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,餘興節目…做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.19,0:09:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想想  比如再現一遍那天發生的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:24.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:29.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如重現那天在這兒發生的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.40,0:09:33.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這兒發生的事是指…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:37.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑  幹什麼要…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.93,0:09:38.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安鳴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.51,0:09:47.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.48,0:09:52.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…你是喜歡芽間的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:54.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.03,0:10:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說話啊  芽間也在這兒吧  說清楚！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.75,0:10:01.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.83,0:10:16.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說…說…說…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂不至於做到這份上吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說…說…說…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:38.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜歡  我喜歡芽間…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.85,0:10:42.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃跑的話又會重複相同的事情  仁太！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.80,0:11:03.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間沒有說話  只是在撲簌落淚…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哭什麼哭啊  真丟人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:17.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我一直很丟人的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:20.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個是雪集想出來的主意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.97,0:11:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  喂  還是算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這不是明擺著的嘛  那天的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.78,0:11:37.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使芽間成佛了  自己依然迷茫下去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.56,0:11:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直輸給已經不在了的芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.51,0:11:42.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你覺得這樣甘心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:46.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鶴子你不會明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:52.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜歡的人一直不理睬自己的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.15,0:11:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.30,0:11:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我喜歡雪集
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.64,0:12:02.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集他一直追著芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.31,0:12:06.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我則一直看著他那樣的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.57,0:12:08.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鶴子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.72,0:12:11.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永遠什麼的沒人知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.18,0:12:14.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間成佛的話  宿海就會…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.15,0:12:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  雪集是永遠不會選擇我的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:26.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使芽間成佛了  作為替代  他也會選擇安城你的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.63,0:12:32.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對  不對  替代什麼的  雪集才不會那麼想的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:36.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我就算再怎麼痛苦也不會和雪集交往的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.66,0:12:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我喜歡仁太啊  才沒有什麼替代品呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.51,0:12:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  沒有什麼替代品
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.99,0:12:50.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以  必須讓芽間成佛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.15,0:13:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起啊  仁太  我前面好像跟著起哄了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噗噗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彷彿覺得所有時間都會倒流
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:15.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到過去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:19.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  剛才說的是真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:22.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  是…  是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:26.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間也喜歡仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.90,0:13:31.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜…  喜歡可不單單指的是朋友之間的喜歡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.57,0:13:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道的  就是想娶我的那種喜歡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.93,0:13:41.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果就這樣普普通通地長大的話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.11,0:13:45.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間會成為仁太的新娘嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.78,0:13:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算沒有普普通通地
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.74,0:13:52.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:57.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算不成佛  你就這樣待著這裡不就行了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.24,0:13:59.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.44,0:14:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.54,0:14:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會成佛的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.25,0:14:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後就會轉世投胎  如果不成佛就轉不了世了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.14,0:14:23.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就不能和大家好好說話了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  但是  如果變成蟲子的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.49,0:14:28.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和大家好好…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:45.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  芽間  仁太說喜歡你  你到底是怎麼回答的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:47.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:51.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她說為了仁太有事要拜託大家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.31,0:14:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答案什麼的我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:54.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我對芽間…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.34,0:14:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明都心知肚明了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.79,0:15:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊  算了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.23,0:15:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成佛吧  好嗎  芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.29,0:15:19.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有我還是不行嗎  芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.17,0:15:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  芽間  你知道轉世投胎嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:40.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轉世投胎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.07,0:15:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對  即使生命終結了  還會再成為嬰兒重新來到這個世上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.13,0:15:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也許轉世後還不是人類  而成為貓咪的嬰兒或者花朵的嬰兒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:57.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以完全不會感到寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:16:00.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.15,0:16:05.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  只有一點  只有一點
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.71,0:16:25.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿姨  再稍微等一下  大家會為我放煙火的  再稍微等等
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.37,0:16:36.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  就先製作煙火的載體吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:37.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.19,0:16:54.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.49,0:16:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉來晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鶴見
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.92,0:17:06.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可愛  鶴子像小時候一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.65,0:17:08.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轉換心情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.82,0:17:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,騙你的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:15.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:20.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太  拿住那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.03,0:17:22.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.07,0:17:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一二
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.58,0:17:29.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.66,0:17:37.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.85,0:17:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  感覺聞到一股似曾相識的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.39,0:17:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你把小聰叫來的  仁太？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.21,0:17:49.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.46,0:17:55.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你  仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:17:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.03,0:17:57.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.31,0:18:01.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的要結束了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.05,0:18:04.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一二
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.89,0:18:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿唷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.56,0:18:11.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.45,0:18:17.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為芽間和我們利害一致
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.17,0:18:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要讓她成佛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.33,0:18:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  現在阻止的話還來得及
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.43,0:18:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宿海  芽間一定很高興吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.74,0:18:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.96,0:18:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不會讓你阻止的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.88,0:18:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在的話還能阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.25,0:18:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還能阻止  但是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:44.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會成佛的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:49.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿唷…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.03,0:18:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  小聰真有力氣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宿海
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.78,0:19:14.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  接下來就只剩發射了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之  幹得還真不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.73,0:19:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…  那個啊  還有什麼想要說的話之類的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.46,0:19:21.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她弟弟也在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.73,0:19:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  也對
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.75,0:19:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼就我單方面的  哇  我非常高興  許多事都謝謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:32.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噗噗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:34.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  仁太也來幾句
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.73,0:19:48.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也差不多要開始了  再晚的話會給居民添麻煩的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:50.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.82,0:19:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.99,0:20:04.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣好嗎  現在的話還能阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.82,0:20:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還能阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:21.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.20,0:20:35.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煙火發射了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:04.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊  花朵在天空盛開了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.03,0:21:13.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.30,0:21:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  她還在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  宿海  仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.52,0:21:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}抱歉  芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.10,0:21:23.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那時這樣想了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.40,0:21:27.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒有消失真是太好了
